			"notes": "PriceSniper v0.1.1\n\nChanges:\n- Added DonutSMP compatibility notice to README (both English and Vietnamese).\n- Full English in-game localization for module settings, chat feedback, and HUD widget.\n- Full proper Vietnamese diacritics in documentation.\n- Robust /sell price detection waiting for actual non-zero slot 53 update.\n- Ascending Pling chime alert when target price is met (enabled by default).\n\nInstallation:\nDrop PriceSniper-0.1.1.jar into your .minecraft/mods folder alongside Meteor Client for Fabric 1.21.x."
		},
