			"notes": "PriceSniper v0.1.0 - Meteor Client Addon\n\nFeatures:\n- Hand-held item and shulker box price checker for /sell GUI.\n- Anti-Sell Safety: automatically retrieves items without clicking the sell button.\n- Aiming Price: ascending note block Pling chime alert when target price is met (enabled by default).\n- Dedicated draggable HUD element displaying item icon, name, price, and age.\n- Tooltip integration displaying the last checked sell price.\n- Meteor command support (.pricesniper check / .ps check).\n\nInstallation:\nDrop PriceSniper-0.1.0.jar into your .minecraft/mods folder alongside Meteor Client for Fabric 1.21.x."
		}
